      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "VALOROUS POWER (2) made up good ground when resuming at Scone over 1600m, finishing runner-up in a decent field there 3 weeks ago. The query for us is the slight drop in trip from 1600m to 1550m, but he will be sharper and could just be too good for this lot. LUSKAIRE (1) is a very capable gelding at this level, and he resumes from a spell with a couple of solid trials under his belt. He usually needs a run, but he is top weight for a reason, and must be respected. BELLEISTIC KIDS (5) can mix his form, and he will find this easier than his last couple of starts in town. He is nicely placed after a 2kg claim, and can bounce back into the top 4 here. ME ME (8) has raced her way into form, and she drops 4.5kg for this with a step up in class. A nice swing in her draw will help, and she is a top 4 player again. SATNESS (4) finished fifth in the Little Dance at Randwick last start, and that form will stand up in this easier assignment. Stick with him on an each-way basis.",
